# The define sets of terrain/main.frag with a Slang twin (task 0072, terrain family): what the GLSL compiles with.
# The names come from Pipeline::terrainDefines (the terrain's settings) and the "#define" lines of shadow.settings and
# terrain.settings. The settings can make 26,040 sets (PipelineTerrainDefines counts them and checks that every line
# here is one of them): too many to build, so this is a part, chosen from the settings profiles below and confirmed with
# OPENEDEN_SHADER_TRACE. Any other set draws with the GLSL. Lines are canonical (sorted, "-" for none).
#
# Without hdr: the maps off, on (normal or specular maps), and on with each parallax quality.
-
TERRAIN_MAPS
PARALLAX_POM TERRAIN_MAPS
PARALLAX_POM PARALLAX_POM_LOW TERRAIN_MAPS
PARALLAX_POM PARALLAX_POM_HIGH TERRAIN_MAPS
#
# hdr without pbr: the G-buffer and the cloud shadows.
GBUFFER
GBUFFER TERRAIN_MAPS
CLOUD_SHADOW
VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
CLOUD_SHADOW VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
CLOUD_SHADOW GBUFFER VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW
#
# hdr and pbr, one feature at a time, without and with `pbr material maps`.
TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
GBUFFER GBUFFER_MATERIAL
GBUFFER GBUFFER_MATERIAL TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL
AO_TERRAIN GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL
AO_TERRAIN GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
GI_SKY
GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
WETNESS
WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
COVER
COVER TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
PARALLAX_POM TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
PARALLAX_POM PARALLAX_POM_LOW TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
PARALLAX_POM PARALLAX_POM_HIGH TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR
#
# hdr and pbr with the weather (atmosphere, cloud and volumetric cloud shadows, wetness with puddles, cover).
CLOUD_SHADOW COVER VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
CLOUD_SHADOW COVER TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
#
# The whole stack (hdr, pbr, gbuffer, ao and `ao terrain`, atmosphere, `gi exterior`, the weather), without maps, with
# `pbr material maps`, and with parallax too.
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY PARALLAX_POM TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
#
# Each debug view once: on the default set, and on the whole stack with `pbr material maps`.
DEBUG_CHUNKS
DEBUG_SHADOW
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_DEBUG WETNESS_PUDDLES
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER COVER_DEBUG GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW CLOUD_SHADOW_DEBUG COVER GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER DEBUG_SHADOW GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER DEBUG_CHUNKS GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
#
# The set of the living test profile (hdr, gbuffer, pbr material maps, parallax, point light shadows, wetness and cover; task 0072, stage j, 2026-11-06). Listed after PipelineTerrainDefines learned POINT_SHADOW.
AO_TERRAIN CLOUD_SHADOW COVER GBUFFER GBUFFER_AMBIENT GBUFFER_MATERIAL GI_SKY PARALLAX_POM POINT_SHADOW TERRAIN_MAPS TERRAIN_PBR VOLUME_CLOUD_SHADOW WETNESS WETNESS_PUDDLES
